# Root-level repro/export artifacts (WAV/MP3 renders, driver scripts, test
# projects, diagnostics from the silent-export investigation). Root-scoped so
# intentional fixtures under tests/ or other subdirs are never hidden.
/*.wav
/*.mp3
/*.hdaw
/*.hdaw3
/*.hdp
/*.js
/*.mjs
/headless_err.txt
/.tmp_probe/
/auto-backups/

# Test-project / audio-media scratch at the repo root (same root-scoped
# rationale as the artifact block above).
/compositions/

# JUCE 9.0.1 source drop held in place for the eventual JUCE 9 engine
# migration. NOT a current dependency — the build uses the JUCE 8 fetch in
# build/_deps. Ignored so the tree stays clean until the upgrade lands.
/JUCE-v9.0.1/




# Binary media & plugin presets — GLOBAL. Audio renders/exports and preset
# files anywhere under the tree (renders/, exports/, sample libraries, etc.)
# are large, regenerable binaries and must never be committed/uploaded.
# (Root-scoped /*.wav and /*.mp3 above only covered the repo root; these
# cover every subdirectory, including nested libraries.)
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
*.aiff
*.aif
*.ogg
*.m4a
*.serumpreset
*.fxp
*.syx
*.hdp
*.vital


